 },
 "summary": "A family of nine single-junction silicon rectifiers in the axial DO-201AD molded package, rated 3.0 A average forward current and 200 A surge, with repetitive peak reverse voltage from 50 V (1N5400) to 1000 V (1N5408). Forward voltage is at most 1.2 V at 3.0 A and reverse current at most 5.0 µA at 25 °C. Uses given are rectification in power supplies, inverters and converters, and freewheeling. 1N5408-E3/54 is the 1000 V part, RoHS-compliant commercial grade, on 13-inch paper tape and reel.",
